  "At easier levels, move slowly until you learn the movement.": "Na lakšim nivoima, krećite se polako dok ne naučite pokret.",
  "At least 120 min of scheduled Zone 2 and about 51 min of hard cardio a week; controlled vigorous blocks on Tuesday, Thursday and Saturday.": "Najmanje 120 minuta planirane zone 2 i oko 51 min tvrdog kardio treninga sedmično; kontrolisane energične blokove u utorak, četvrtak i subotu.",
  "At New to training and Returning, keep the pace brisk and below all-out effort. At Active, work hard. At Well trained, use all-out effort.": "At New to training and Returning, držite brz tempo i ispod svih napora. At Active, naporno radi. At Well trained, uloži sav trud.",
  "At Returning and above, hold a dumbbell in each hand, or loop a band around your waist with its anchor in front of you. The band should pull you forward, like a sled.": "At Returning and above, držite bučicu u svakoj ruci ili omotajte traku oko struka sa sidrom ispred sebe. Traka bi te trebala vući naprijed, kao sanke.",
  "At Returning, push back up with your hands. At higher levels, pull yourself back with your hamstrings.": "At Returning, odgurnite se rukama. At higher levels, povucite se nazad svojim tetivama.",
  "At the end of your last interval, note your peak heart rate. Walk gently for 60 seconds and note your heart rate again. Enter the drop (peak minus 60s reading).": "Na kraju vašeg posljednjeg intervala, zabilježite svoj najveći broj otkucaja srca. Nežno hodajte 60 sekundi i ponovo zabilježite broj otkucaja srca. Unesite pad (vrh minus 60s očitavanje).",
