  "Bryan adds a weighted vest during Zone 2 walks and hikes to increase axial bone loading safely.": "Bryan dodaje prsluk sa utezima tokom šetnji i planinarenja u Zoni 2 kako bi sigurno povećao aksijalno opterećenje kostiju.",
  "Bryan calls the phone the worst trigger for bad posture. Hold it at eye level and put the top of your monitor at eye level too.": "Bryan telefon naziva najgorim okidačem za loše držanje. Držite ga u visini očiju i postavite gornji dio monitora u nivo očiju.",
  "Bryan calls this technical and was taught it for his own diagnosed condition. Stay gentle, and stop if you get dizziness, tingling or a headache.": "Bryan ovo naziva tehničkim i naučio ga je zbog svog dijagnostikovanog stanja. Budite nježni i prestanite ako dobijete vrtoglavicu, trnce ili glavobolju.",
  "Bryan demo with timestamp": "Bryan demo s vremenskom oznakom",
  "Bryan demonstrates it at {time} ({clock})": "Bryan to demonstrira na {time} ({clock})",
  "Bryan did 1 × 10 in 2023. His 2025 Galpin session includes Nordic curls in the strength block. They protect against hamstring strains.": "Bryan je napravio 1 × 10 2023. Njegova Galpin sesija 2025. uključuje nordijske kovrče u bloku snage. Štiti od naprezanja tetive koljena.",
  "Bryan does “butterfly pulls” with a resistance band, 1 × 15. Most write-ups describe it as a band chest fly; watch his clip to copy his exact version.": "Bryan izvodi “leptir povlačenje” sa otpornom trakom, 1 × 15. Većina pisanja to opisuje kao traku za grudi; pogledajte njegov klip da kopirate njegovu tačnu verziju.",
  "Bryan does 3 × 10 per leg, learned from Ben Patrick, the Knees-Over-Toes coach working with him on his 2026 dunk project. It builds the inner quad (VMO) and knee resilience.": "Bryan radi 3 × 10 po nozi, naučio je od Bena Patricka, trenera Knees-Over-Toes koji s njim radi na njegovom projektu zakucavanja 2026. godine. Izgrađuje unutrašnji četverostruk (VMO) i otpornost koljena.",
  "Bryan does both grips": "Bryan radi oba zahvata",
  "Bryan does both. His 2025 Galpin session includes them in the strength block at 2 × 5–8. His official beginner list uses assisted pull-ups.": "Bryan radi oboje. Njegova Galpin sesija iz 2025. uključuje ih u blok snage na 2 × 5–8. Njegova službena početnička lista koristi potpomognuta zgibanja.",
  "Bryan does the Pallof press in his 2025 session with Dr. Andy Galpin. It trains the trunk to resist twisting.": "Bryan vodi Pallof press na svojoj sesiji 2025. s dr. Andyjem Galpinom. On trenira trup da se odupre uvijanju.",
  "Bryan does tibialis raises (1 × 25, single-leg in his list). His 2026 dunk notes mention limited ankle dorsiflexion. This exercise works on that movement.": "Bryan radi podizanja tibijalisa (1 × 25, jedna noga na njegovoj listi). Njegove bilješke o zakucavanju iz 2026. spominju ograničenu dorzalnu fleksiju skočnog zgloba. Ova vježba djeluje na taj pokret.",
  "Bryan has been training to dunk at 49 since July 2026, using heavy lifts with jumps between sets. He says he needs more fast-twitch fibres and faster force development, and warns about Achilles risk from landing forces. Learn to land before working on height.": "Bryan je trenirao zakucavanje u 49 od jula 2026, koristeći teška dizanja sa skokovima između setova. Kaže da mu je potrebno više brzih vlakana i brži razvoj snaga, te upozorava na Ahilov rizik od sletanja. Naučite sletjeti prije rada na visini.",
