  "Bryan: 60+ strict continuous reps (chest to floor, zero top pauses). Harvard study: 40+ push-ups correlated with 96% lower cardiovascular events.": "Bryan: 60+ strogih kontinuiranih ponavljanja (prsa do poda, nula pauza na vrhu). Harvardska studija: 40+ sklekova korelira sa 96% nižim kardiovaskularnim događajima.",
