  "Bryan: seated calf raises 1 × 25. The standing single-leg version adds Achilles preparation for jumping, his own 2026 concern.": "Bryan: sjedeći list podiže 1 × 25. Stojeća verzija s jednom nogom dodaje Ahilovu pripremu za skakanje, njegovu ličnu brigu za 2026. godinu.",
  "Bryan: to fatigue, 2×/wk": "Bryan: do umora, 2×/ sedmično",
  "Bryan’s 2025 Galpin session includes these in the speed and power block (2 × 5). You need about 2 m of clear floor to move sideways.": "Bryanova Galpin sesija 2025. uključuje ih u blok brzine i snage (2 × 5). Za bočno kretanje vam je potrebno oko 2 m čistog poda.",
  "Bryan’s 2025 session has a rotational power slot (2 × 5), and his Bone Density protocol lists medicine-ball throws. Use a fast band chop at home.": "Bryanova sesija 2025. ima rotacijski utor za snagu (2 × 5), a njegov protokol gustoće kostiju navodi bacanja medicinske lopte. Koristite brzu traku za sjeckanje kod kuće.",
  "Bryan’s 2026 dunk training is built on heavy pulls (a 385 lb, about 175 kg, PR on 4 Sep 2026, followed straight away by jumps), and his bone protocol names deadlifts. The dumbbell Romanian deadlift provides the heavy hip-hinge work in this plan.": "Bryanov trening zakucavanja 2026. je izgrađen na teškim potezima (385 lb, oko 175 kg, PR 4. septembra 2026., nakon čega su odmah uslijedili skokovi), a njegov protokol za kosti naziva mrtvo dizanje. Rumunsko mrtvo dizanje bučica pruža težak rad na zglobovima kuka u ovom planu.",
  "Bryan’s Bone Density protocol (Apr 2026) puts jumping and hopping into the warm-up 4–7 times a week. He mentions stiff tendons and Achilles risk in his 2026 dunk training notes. This plan gives the tendons a small daily dose of work.": "Bryanov protokol gustine kostiju (april 2026.) stavlja skakanje i skakanje u zagrijavanje 4-7 puta sedmično. On spominje ukočene tetive i Ahilov rizik u svojim bilješkama sa treninga za 2026. godinu. Ovaj plan daje tetivama malu dnevnu dozu rada.",
  "Bryan’s Bone Density protocol (Apr 2026): high ground-reaction shockwaves stimulate osteoblast mineral deposition to maintain 99th percentile bone density.": "Bryanov protokol gustine kostiju (april 2026.): udarni valovi s visokom reakcijom tla stimuliraju taloženje minerala osteoblasta kako bi se održala 99. percentilna gustoća kostiju.",
  "Bryan’s Friday session in his newest weekly template (exercise newsletter, 4 Oct 2026) includes step-ups at 3 × 10 per leg. His bone protocol also uses box step-ups for power training.": "Bryanova sesija u petak u njegovom najnovijem sedmičnom predlošku (bilten o vježbama, 4. oktobar 2026.) uključuje korake 3 × 10 po nozi. Njegov protokol za kosti također koristi box step-up za trening snage.",
  "Bryan’s Friday template: lunges, overhead press, chest press, step-ups and side planks. Start with power work in Galpin’s order, then use Bryan’s 2026 pairing of heavy hip hinges followed by jumps.": "Bryanov šablon za petak: iskoraci, potisak iznad glave, potisak na grudima, stepenice i bočne daske. Počnite s radom po Galpinovom redoslijedu, a zatim upotrijebite Bryanovo uparivanje teških šarki kukova iz 2026. nakon čega slijede skokovi.",
  "Bryan’s guide says holding good posture uses muscles that may feel sore at first. Sharp pain, tingling or headaches are reasons to stop and get checked.": "Bryanov vodič kaže da držanje dobrog držanja koristi mišiće koji u početku mogu osjetiti bol. Oštar bol, trnci ili glavobolja su razlozi da prestanete i da se pregledate.",
  "Bryan's gym exercise": "Bryanova vježba u teretani",
  "Bryan’s mobility and strength exercises, including pulling, Knees-Over-Toes work and high-rep arm work, followed by Zone 2 toward his weekly target. This is the first of two posture strength days.": "Bryanove vježbe mobilnosti i snage, uključujući povlačenje, rad koljena preko nožnih prstiju i rad ruku s velikim brojem ponavljanja, nakon čega slijedi Zona 2 prema svom tjednom cilju. Ovo je prvi od dva dana snage držanja.",
  "Bryan’s official light day: 20–30 min of gentle yoga or stretching.": "Bryanov službeni svjetlosni dan: 20-30 minuta nježne joge ili istezanja.",
  "Bryan’s official list: arm circles, wall slides, thread the needle, hip CARs.": "Bryanova službena lista: krugovi za ruke, zidni klizači, konac na iglu, automobili za kukove.",
  "Bryan’s official protocol includes both versions in its stability exercises: the single-leg RDL and single-leg toe touch.": "Bryanov službeni protokol uključuje obje verzije u svojim vježbama stabilnosti: RDL jednom nogom i dodir prstiju s jednom nogom.",
  "Bryan’s official warm-up uses arm circles, leg swings, high knees and lateral lunges. Hip CARs and the lunge with twist come from his mobility day and his 2025 warm-up with Dr. Andy Galpin.": "Bryanovo službeno zagrijavanje koristi krugove rukama, zamahe nogom, visoka koljena i bočne iskorake. Hip CARs i iskorak s okretom dolaze iz njegovog dana mobilnosti i njegovog zagrijavanja 2025. s dr. Andyjem Galpinom.",
  "Bryan’s official yoga block includes cat-cow, cobbler’s pose, tree pose and cobra. Stay longer when you have time; his version lasts 15 min.": "Bryanov službeni joga blok uključuje mačku kravu, pozu postolara, pozu drveta i kobru. Ostanite duže kada imate vremena; njegova verzija traje 15 min.",
  "Bryan’s physical-therapist exercise #1. Official wording (2026): “With weights in your hands, bring your shoulders up and out. Keep your elbows back. Do 1 set to fatigue 2 times a week.” He uses about 9 kg (20 lb); his posture coach’s patients usually start near 3.5 kg (8 lb).": "Bryanova vježba fizioterapeuta br. Zvanična formulacija (2026.): \"S utezima u rukama, podignite ramena i izvucite ih. Laktove zadržite unazad. Uradite 1 set za umor 2 puta sedmično.\" Koristi oko 9 kg (20 lb); Pacijenti njegovog trenera za držanje obično počinju da teže blizu 3,5 kg (8 lb).",
  "Bryan’s physical-therapist exercise #2. Official wording (2026): “With a hand on your forehead, resist the pressure of your hand pushing your head back. When doing this, be very patient.” He does it to fatigue twice a week.": "Bryanova vježba fizioterapeuta #2. Zvanična formulacija (2026): \"S rukom na čelu, oduprite se pritisku ruke koja gura glavu unazad. Kada to radite, budite vrlo strpljivi.\" To radi do umora dva puta sedmično.",
  "Bryan’s posture coach walks him through the neck and shoulder exercises.": "Bryanov trener držanja vodi ga kroz vježbe za vrat i ramena.",
  "Bryan's protocol and home alternatives": "Bryanov protokol i kućne alternative",
  "Bryan’s protocol: at least 150 min a week of moderate activity (Zone 2) during which you can hold a conversation.": "Bryanov protokol: najmanje 150 minuta sedmično umjerene aktivnosti (zona 2) tokom kojih možete voditi razgovor.",
  "Bryan's protocol: mechanical shock signals osteoblasts to deposit minerals. Keep knees slightly soft to protect cartilage while the bone absorbs the force.": "Bryanov protokol: mehanički udar signalizira osteoblastima da talože minerale. Neka koljena budu blago mekana kako biste zaštitili hrskavicu dok kost apsorbira silu.",
  "Bryan’s published options for bodyweight HIIT: jumping jacks, high knees, mountain climbers, burpees without the push-up, jump squats, plus marching and bodyweight squats for beginners.": "Bryanove objavljene opcije za HIIT sa tjelesnom težinom: skakanje, visoka koljena, planinski penjači, burpi bez sklekova, čučnjevi u skoku, plus marširanje i čučnjevi s tjelesnom težinom za početnike.",
  "Bryan's rule: injury prevention comes first. Swap to the easier variant whenever a joint complains; never train through sharp pain.": "Brajanovo pravilo: prevencija povreda je na prvom mestu. Prebacite se na lakšu varijantu kad god se zglob požali; nikada ne trenirajte kroz oštar bol.",
  "Bryan's video or post": "Bryanov video ili objava",
