  "Plan and track six home workouts a week based on Bryan Johnson's public exercise protocol. You'll do strength training three days a week, plus short intervals, the Norwegian 4×4, Zone 2, balance and mobility. The workouts use bodyweight, adjustable dumbbells, a pull-up bar and bands.": "Planirajte i pratite šest kućnih treninga sedmično na osnovu protokola javnih vježbi Bryana Johnsona. Radit ćete trening snage tri dana u sedmici, plus kratke intervale, norveški 4×4, zona 2, ravnoteža i mobilnost. Treninzi koriste tjelesnu težinu, podesive bučice, šipku za povlačenje i trake.",
