  "Train anyway": "Voz u svakom slučaju",
  "Train strength on Monday, Wednesday and Friday, do short intervals on Tuesday and the Norwegian 4×4 on Thursday, then mixed cardio on Saturday. Rest on Sunday. Zone 2 and controlled vigorous blocks build toward Bryan Johnson's weekly cardio targets. His public protocol is adapted here for bodyweight, adjustable dumbbells, a pull-up bar and bands.": "Vježbajte snagu u ponedjeljak, srijedu i petak, radite kratke intervale u utorak i norveški 4×4 u četvrtak, a zatim mješoviti kardio u subotu. Odmor u nedelju. Zona 2 i kontrolisani snažni blokovi grade se prema sedmičnim kardio ciljevima Bryana Johnsona. Njegov javni protokol je ovdje prilagođen za tjelesnu težinu, podesive bučice, šipku za povlačenje i trake.",
