  "Voice coach": "Glasovni trener",
  "Voice coach has a Download voice button for any included voice that is not ready, with clip-by-clip progress. Downloading also starts automatically when coaching is already on, and Preview waits until the voice is ready.": "Voice coach ima dugme za preuzimanje glasa za svaki uključeni glas koji nije spreman, sa napredovanjem isječak po klip. Preuzimanje također počinje automatski kada je obuka već uključena, a pregled čeka dok glas ne bude spreman.",
